OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 13, on way to school before
OL,4,Aattempted rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old girl who fought off an
OL,7,Fattempted rape was on her way to school
OL,8,Fwhen the attack happened, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe teenager was sexually assaulted in
OL,12,FNunnery Wood in Worcester at about
OL,13,F08:15 GMT on Tuesday before fleeing and
OL,14,Fseeking help from a member of the
OL,15,Fpublic.
OL,17,FThe suspect is described as mixed race
OL,18,For Asian and between 16 and 18 years of
OL,19,Fage, West Mercia Police said.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
